MODIFICATIONS:

Datajack (Tier 3): Datajacks are direct neural interface implants that allow you to directly access computers and information with your mind. They typically resemble a coin-sized dataport that is implanted either on the side of the head (typically in the temporal region of the skull, behind the ear or on the temple) or the back of the neck (just below the brainstem). It comes with a retractable spool of micro-cable (about a meter long) that lets you directly interface with any electronic device via a universal access cable. Datajacks are equipped with their own cache of storage memory for downloading or saving files. Optionally, Datajacks can be installed to be hidden and use an induction link hidden under the skin, but the response rate of the interface drops by around 15-20%.

Commlink (Tier 3): The implanted version of the commlink.

Tailored Pheromones (Tier 2): These pheromones are specially tailored to subtly influence others and can be released at will. Tailored pheromones adds a bonus equal to its tier rating to all charisma based skills, but only when the person you’re using them on is within a comfortable conversation range and able to smell you. 

Bone Density Augmentation (Tier 2): The molecular structure of your bones is altered to increase density and tensile strength. Ligaments are strengthened, and the increased bone density increases your weight a bit. Bone density augmentation is incompatible with other augmentations to the bones, including bone lacing cyberware.

Muscle Augmentation (Tier 2): This biological weaving treatment enhances existing muscle tissue, rather than replacing it with vat-grown muscles. Specially grown muscle cables are woven into existing muscle fibers, enhancing muscle mass and brute strength while providing a bulkier look. Muscle augmentation adds a bonus to your Strength equal to its tier rating. This augmentation is incompatible with augmentations that increase Strength, including the muscle replacements cyberware.

Muscle Toner (Tier 2): This treatment increases muscle fiber elasticity in existing muscle tension, resulting in increased muscle tension and flexibility while providing a smooth and ropy physique. Muscle toner adds a bonus to your Dexterity equal to its tier rating. This augmentation is incompatible with augmentations that increase Dexterity, including the muscle replacements cyberware.

Synaptic Booster (Tier 2): The nerve cells making up the spinal cord are both broadened and replicated with this bioware, allowing for more neural bandwidth. The result is a much faster reaction time. The booster confers a bonus equal to its tier rating to your Initiative. The synaptic booster cannot be combined with any other form of Initiative enhancement.

Damage Compensators (Tier 2): Damage compensators are essentially cut-offs stored in the nervous pathways that report pain from the body back to your brain.

TRAITS:

True Futanari: A True Futanari has a fully functional vagina that looks like a normal vagina, and a fully functional penis that looks like a penis. They do not have testicles or functional ovaries, and so are also sterile. What really sets True Futanari apart from normal futanari is that both sets of genitals are not only fully functional, but also equally accessible. They also have all the combined internal geography of a male and a female, meaning g-spot, cervix, prostate, etc).

